{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35836","headline":"秋夕书怀寄所知 · 李咸用","name":"秋夕书怀寄所知","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋萤一点雨中飞，独立黄昏思所知。\n三岛路遥身汩没，九天风急羽差池。\n年华逐浪催霜髪，旅恨和云拂桂知。\n不向故人言此事，异乡谁更念栖迟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李咸用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35836.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35836","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}